evin Harper, who signed revenue sharing contracts to return to the Rebels this season before joining former coach Lane Kiffin at LSU.","published":"2026-07-29T12:13:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49475144/ole-miss-sues-former-players-princewill-umanmielen-devin-harper-now-lsu-breach-contract","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oregon RB Dierre Hill Jr. limps off with injury in win vs. Michigan State","description":"Oregon running back Dierre Hill Jr. limped off the field with an injury in the first quarter against Michigan State on Friday night.","published":"2026-11-21T05:36:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50545816/oregon-running-back-dierre-hill-exits-vs-michigan-state-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Revised Protect College Sports Act allows conferences to expand up to 22 schools","description":"Federal lawmakers published a revised version of the Protect College Sports Act on Friday as the U.S. House of Representatives prepares to push for a vote during the first week of December. President Donald Trump also voiced his support for the bill.","published":"2026-11-21T02:51:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50545220/protect-college-sports-act-revised-donald-trump-voices-support","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Dan Murphy","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football games this weekend: Top 25 schedule","description":"Here's what to know about the college football slate for the Top 25 this weekend.","published":"2026-11-20T21:19:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542897/college-football-games-top-25-schedule-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-20T20:45:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-20T20:32:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami WR Malachi Toney 'really close' to return after ankle surgery, coach says","description":"Miami star wide receiver Malachi Toney is about a week and a half from returning from surgery for a high ankle sprain, coach Mario Cristobal told \"The Pat McAfee Show.\"","published":"2026-11-20T19:00:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542494/malachi-toney-nearing-return-ankle-surgery-coach-says","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Draft buzz: Interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could spur draft trade","description":"If the Titans or Chargers wind up with the No. 1 selection and stick with their franchise quarterbacks, interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could lead to a team seeking to trade up for the top overall pick.","published":"2026-11-20T21:59:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50541939/draft-buzz-mestemaker-spur-auction-no-1-pick","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-20T15:55:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4917971/princewill-umanmielen","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princewill_Umanmielen"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Princewill Umanmielen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princewill_Umanmielen","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:37Z","intro":"Princewill Umanmielen (born February 13, 2005) is an American college football linebacker for the LSU Tigers. He previously played for the Nebraska Cornhuskers and Ole Miss Rebels.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Umanmielen attended Manor High School in Manor, Texas. In his final two seasons, he totaled 47 tackles for loss and 21 sacks. A four-star recruit, Umanmielen committed to play college football at the University of Nebraska–Lincoln over offers from Arkansas, Florida, and Washington."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"NEBRASKA\nAs a freshman, Umanmielen recorded 22 tackles, 4.5 tackles-for-loss, and a sack. As a result, he was named a second-team freshman All-American. The following season, he tallied 13 tackles and 2.5 tackles-for-loss, before entering the transfer portal.\n\nOLE MISS\nOn December 14, 2024, Umanmielen, a top-ranked transfer, announced his decision to transfer to the University of Mississippi to play for the Ole Miss Rebels."}],"family":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Princely Umanmielen","description":"American football defensive end (born 2002)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princely_Umanmielen"}]}}